Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.82,0:00:12.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Congratulations on this\Nmomentous occasion!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.78,0:00:15.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You boys came very close\Nto missing the cutoff date.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.04,0:00:17.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But there's no doubt,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.44,0:00:21.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,what you brought us is the third place\Nlottery ticket worth five million yen!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.86,0:00:23.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And with that being said,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.70,0:00:28.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,take this, it's the promissory note you'll\Nuse to receive the five million yen.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.26,0:00:30.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's standard procedure.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.46,0:00:34.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please allow us three days to process\Nbefore collecting your winnings.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.48,0:00:37.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Holy wilders.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.92,0:00:41.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,One, ten, hundred, thousand? What?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.88,0:00:43.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's got six zeros.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.48,0:00:44.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ha-ha-ha!
Dialogue: 1,0:01:09.67,0:01:11.84,Part 4 OP2 Japanese,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}{\1c&HFAF2ED&}taisetsu na mono ubawaresou
Dialogue: 1,0:01:09.67,0:01:11.84,Part 4 OP2 English,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}{\1c&HFAF2ED&}Something important is being taken from me
Dialogue: 1,0:01:11.84,0:01:14.26,Part 4 OP2 Japanese,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}{\1c&HFAF2ED&}nichijou ni magirekonda akuma
Dialogue: 1,0:01:11.84,0:01:14.26,Part 4 OP2 English,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}{\1c&HFAF2ED&}By a demon that's thrust itself into my life
Dialogue: 1,0:01:14.26,0:01:17.64,Part 4 OP2 Japanese,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}{\1c&HC4B3D4&}heion nara tokkuni kuzuresatteru
Dialogue: 1,0:01:14.26,0:01:17.64,Part 4 OP2 English,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}{\1c&HC4B3D4&}Everything is crumbling around me
Dialogue: 1,0:01:14.26,0:01:17.64,Part 4 OP2 Japanese,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}{\1c&HC4B3D4&}heion na toki kuzuresatteru
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.46,0:01:17.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 1,0:01:18.26,0:01:20.43,Part 4 OP2 Japanese,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}{\1c&HECEEEE&}nanigenai soshite sarigenai
Dialogue: 1,0:01:18.26,0:01:20.43,Part 4 OP2 English,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}{\1c&HECEEEE&}Living my life as if everything was fine
Dialogue: 1,0:01:20.43,0:01:22.81,Part 4 OP2 Japanese,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}{\1c&HECEEEE&}kizu ga nai uchi ni ubawareteita
Dialogue: 1,0:01:20.43,0:01:22.81,Part 4 OP2 English,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}{\1c&HECEEEE&}Until suddenly it was stolen away without warning
Dialogue: 1,0:01:22.81,0:01:26.27,Part 4 OP2 Japanese,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}{\1c&HECEEEE&}torikaeshi ni iku nara ima sa
Dialogue: 1,0:01:22.81,0:01:26.27,Part 4 OP2 English,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}{\1c&HECEEEE&}This is my only chance to take it back
Dialogue: 1,0:01:26.27,0:01:30.61,Part 4 OP2 Japanese,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}{\1c&HF8E3D2&}tsuranuita ya no youna surudosa de
Dialogue: 1,0:01:26.27,0:01:30.61,Part 4 OP2 English,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}{\1c&HF8E3D2&}Those who fight with a heart pierced by the arrow
Dialogue: 1,0:01:30.61,0:01:34.11,Part 4 OP2 Japanese,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}{\1c&HF8E3D2&}butsukeau kokoro wa utsukushii
Dialogue: 1,0:01:30.61,0:01:34.11,Part 4 OP2 English,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}{\1c&HF8E3D2&}Are a beautiful sight to behold
Dialogue: 1,0:01:34.11,0:01:35.15,Part 4 OP2 Japanese,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,0)}{\1c&HF8E3D2&}doko mademo chase you
Dialogue: 1,0:01:34.11,0:01:35.15,Part 4 OP2 English,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,0)}{\1c&HF8E3D2&}Anywhere you go I'll chase you
Dialogue: 1,0:01:35.15,0:01:36.78,Part 4 OP2 Japanese,,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,100)}{\1c&HC3F0FA&}doko mademo chase you
Dialogue: 1,0:01:35.15,0:01:36.78,Part 4 OP2 English,,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,100)}{\1c&HC3F0FA&}Anywhere you go I'll chase you
Dialogue: 1,0:01:36.78,0:01:38.91,Part 4 OP2 Japanese,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}{\1c&HC3F0FA&}itsumo chase you
Dialogue: 1,0:01:36.78,0:01:38.91,Part 4 OP2 English,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}{\1c&HC3F0FA&}I'll always chase you
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.68,0:01:40.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 1,0:01:38.91,0:01:41.08,Part 4 OP2 Japanese,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}{\1c&HC3F0FA&}ore wa chase you
Dialogue: 1,0:01:38.91,0:01:41.08,Part 4 OP2 English,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}{\1c&HC3F0FA&}I will chase you
Dialogue: 1,0:01:41.08,0:01:42.66,Part 4 OP2 Japanese,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}{\1c&HD6ECF9&}nigeba wa nai
Dialogue: 1,0:01:41.08,0:01:42.66,Part 4 OP2 English,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}{\1c&HD6ECF9&}You can't escape me
Dialogue: 1,0:01:42.66,0:01:45.33,Part 4 OP2 Japanese,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}{\1c&HD6ECF9&}hashiridase chase you
Dialogue: 1,0:01:42.66,0:01:45.33,Part 4 OP2 English,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}{\1c&HD6ECF9&}Run faster as I chase you
Dialogue: 1,0:01:45.33,0:01:47.46,Part 4 OP2 Japanese,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}{\1c&HD6ECF9&}asu mo chase you
Dialogue: 1,0:01:45.33,0:01:47.46,Part 4 OP2 English,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}{\1c&HD6ECF9&}Even tomorrow I'll chase you
Dialogue: 1,0:01:47.46,0:01:50.34,Part 4 OP2 Japanese,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}{\1c&HD6ECF9&}tataki tsukete yaru no sa
Dialogue: 1,0:01:47.46,0:01:50.34,Part 4 OP2 English,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}{\1c&HD6ECF9&}Until I finally pummel you
