Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.62,0:02:11.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's regarding your winning ticket.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.90,0:02:13.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Refresh my memory, if you would.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.72,0:02:16.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Which store did you say\Nyou procured it from?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.20,0:02:19.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You want to know where we got it?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.98,0:02:22.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why would you want to\Nknow something like that?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.40,0:02:23.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is there a problem?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.62,0:02:26.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, it's a simple formality.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.40,0:02:27.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.50,0:02:33.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Dim-witted ding-dongs, you expect me to\Nbelieve you won five million yen? Please!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.08,0:02:38.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My teller senses have never failed me\Nand you hoodlums reek of foul play!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.38,0:02:41.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Dear me, what's this?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.40,0:02:43.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Am I sensing hesitation? Odd.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.86,0:02:46.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh no, your question just\Ncaught me off guard is all.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.52,0:02:48.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We bought the ticket in Morioh.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.12,0:02:48.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.03,0:02:51.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, I have to tell you\Nthat's very peculiar.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.48,0:02:54.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Not a single store in Morioh\Nsells lottery tickets,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.58,0:02:56.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,so I find your story hard to swallow.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.98,0:03:03.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.89,0:03:05.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, yeah. That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.50,0:03:09.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We must have picked it up when\Nwe went to a city the other day.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.50,0:03:11.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Of course, it's all coming back to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.06,0:03:13.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We bought so much stuff that day.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.70,0:03:15.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I totally forgot what he said.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.64,0:03:16.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It was so long ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.72,0:03:17.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You know.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.63,0:03:23.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,While we're on the subject,\NI found another discrepancy.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.56,0:03:26.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you look on the reverse side of the.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.52,0:03:29.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You'll find spaces for the ticket holder.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.54,0:03:32.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,to write in their name\Nand telephone number.
