Dialogue: 1,0:03:38.57,0:03:38.61,Episode 19 Typesetting 1,Sign,0,0,0,,{=11}{\be0.1\frx4\fry0\frz14.1\pos(881.21,382.69)}Morishita Ichiro
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.58,0:03:40.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And unless I'm losing my eyesight,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.94,0:03:44.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the name written here doesn't seem\Nto match any of yours, does it?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.44,0:03:46.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's a name written on the back?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.38,0:03:47.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And a phone number, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.78,0:03:51.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, jeez, how did none of us\Nremember to check for that stuff?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.36,0:03:53.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just ignore him.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.58,0:03:57.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Me, oh my, you've found yourselves\Nin quite the peculiar predicament.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.92,0:04:00.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is this your lottery ticket or not?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.90,0:04:02.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I want an honest answer.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.46,0:04:04.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, yeah, I know what happened.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.60,0:04:09.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A friend gave me his new number, and I\Nguess I accidentally wrote it on the back.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.38,0:04:10.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Friend, eh?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.32,0:04:11.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, why didn't you say so?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.92,0:04:12.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We'll give Mr.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.83,0:04:16.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Morishita a ring and get this entire\Nmess cleared up lickety-split.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.84,0:04:20.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It might interest you, gentlemen,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.78,0:04:22.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,to know all lottery\Ntickets are traceable to
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.78,0:04:25.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,their point of purchase\Nvia their serial number.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.46,0:04:28.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If this Ichiro Morishita\Nfellow did indeed purchase
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.82,0:04:31.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,a lottery ticket and can\Nremember where he bought it,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.78,0:04:34.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,we'll be obliged to confirm his signature.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.30,0:04:37.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's a tedious process, but\Nvital for security purposes.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.44,0:04:43.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,To whom does this\Nmysterious ticket belong?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.98,0:04:50.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Depending on our findings, we may have\Nto turn it over to the police. What?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.82,0:04:51.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The police?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.24,0:04:54.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Morishita speaking.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.20,0:04:55.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Who is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.86,0:04:56.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hello, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.77,0:04:58.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm a teller at Budogaoka Bank.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.64,0:05:01.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I have a question only\Nyou can answer. Did a Mr.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.00,0:05:05.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Morishita recently purchase a\Ngreat year-end lottery ticket?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.72,0:05:07.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I'm Ichiro Morishita.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.12,0:05:09.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I bought the little sucker.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.52,0:05:14.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No doubt about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.00,0:05:17.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.02,0:05:20.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now I've got you\Ndunder-headed delinquents!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.68,0:05:22.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I knew you were lying through your teeth!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.84,0:05:26.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hell would freeze over before the gods\Nbestowed the winning ticket on pathetic,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.80,0:05:28.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,money-grubbing goons like you!
Dialogue: 1,0:05:34.02,0:05:34.14,Episode 19 Typesetting 1a,Sign,0,0,0,,{\be0.2\fry-0.35\frx2.1\fax0.25\pos(859.466,265.334)\frz9.347\clip(m 861 164 l 862 172 865 180 868 186 869 189 873 196 875 202 877 208 878 214 882 221 883 224 886 232 888 236 891 243 893 248 896 254 900 262 903 266 914 284 229 652 61 67 830 59)}{\bord10\blur10}Mori{\bord0\blur0}shita Ichiro
