Dialogue: 1,0:05:34.77,0:05:35.52,Episode 19 Typesetting 1a,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fs170\be0.5\frz10.41\pos(376.533,356.267)}Morishita
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.28,0:05:36.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And you're sure, sir?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.88,0:05:39.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're positive you bought a ticket?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.34,0:05:40.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sure, didn't you hear me?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.90,0:05:43.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I must have bought ten of\Nthem, but would you know it?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.08,0:05:43.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They're all duds.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.00,0:05:45.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, except for this one
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.80,0:05:50.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Normally, I changed the whole\Nthing, but this ought to do it
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.78,0:05:54.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We will need a signature mr.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.74,0:05:57.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Kinoshita, but the ticket\Nis all yours Kinoshita?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.00,0:05:59.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My name's Morishita.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.84,0:06:00.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.34,0:06:06.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What I don't understand I could have\Nsworn it was the character for Mariah Uh,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.66,0:06:11.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,your phone number is 1771-1281,\Ncorrect, Mr. Kinoshita?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.06,0:06:14.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I told you, my name's Morishita, pinhead.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.92,0:06:18.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why are you even wasting\Nmy time with this bullshit?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.72,0:06:23.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Maybe you should try selling me a winner\Ninstead of bugging me over the damn phone.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.62,0:06:25.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So sorry to trouble you.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.22,0:06:27.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This isn't over yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.72,0:06:29.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You boys wait right there.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.28,0:06:32.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The number you have reached\Nis no longer in service.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.62,0:06:34.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please check the number\Nof your desired party.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.98,0:06:36.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We told you that the ticket was ours.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.82,0:06:37.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Tell her, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.92,0:06:41.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please accept my congratulations\Nand deepest apologies.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.62,0:06:45.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Whoo! Happy day!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.40,0:06:46.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I got my money!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.74,0:06:51.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It was a lot of hard work, but now\NI'm five million years richer. Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.84,0:06:53.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What is that supposed to mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.30,0:06:56.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You promised we'd get half\Nof that lottery money!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.38,0:06:57.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Shigechi!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.02,0:06:59.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh? Uh...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.98,0:07:02.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Did I say that? I don't recall.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.92,0:07:05.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, you're gonna try\Nand pull that shit again.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.94,0:07:06.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, what are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.02,0:07:07.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Josuke?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.93,0:07:08.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why are you holding me back?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.85,0:07:12.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't tell me you're letting this\Nroly-poly shit back get away with it.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.20,0:07:14.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, no He's not getting\Noff scot-free this time.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.02,0:07:17.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, this kid's gloves\Nare coming off Shigechi
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.68,0:07:20.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now that's what I'm talking about.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.80,0:07:22.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I knew you wouldn't\Nback down from a fight,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.96,0:07:26.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,especially when there's\Nso much on the line So you
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.08,0:07:28.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,just up and decided not to\Nsplit the money anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.66,0:07:29.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is that it?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.57,0:07:33.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sorry, but that's not going to fly\Nwhen it comes to this kind of cash.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.08,0:07:38.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Here.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.02,0:07:41.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This should get you two\Nbeggars off my back.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.12,0:07:45.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's not like you did anything\Nto deserve this money.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.34,0:07:49.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Think of this handout as a pity payment\Nfrom your friendly neighborhood...
