Dialogue: 2,0:07:50.40,0:07:50.44,SFX,1,0,0,0,,{=7}{\blur0.6\bord0\fscx130\fscy100\frz354.2\pos(1395.4,559.2)\4a&HFF&}Kapow!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.42,0:07:52.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Whoa! Son of a...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.60,0:07:53.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, Okuyasu, don't!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.84,0:07:55.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You jerk off! Give it here!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.68,0:07:58.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You promised us half the winnings,\Nso half is what we're gonna get!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.70,0:08:00.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't make me say it again!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.42,0:08:02.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You got up easy today, greedy bastard!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.24,0:08:04.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You always go straight\Nto using your fists.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.28,0:08:05.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You gotta control yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.78,0:08:10.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Tonkin wasn't gonna work on him, so I\Nthought some manhandling would do the trick.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.96,0:08:12.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're not hurt too bad, are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.72,0:08:14.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I want to apologize for Okuyasu.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.98,0:08:16.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He never should have hit you.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.26,0:08:17.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But this just proves it.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.62,0:08:22.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Our partnership isn't working out, so I\Nthink we'll hold on to the promissory note.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.08,0:08:24.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That'll be the best move\Nfor everyone involved.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.92,0:08:27.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We'll cash it in three days as planned.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.38,0:08:31.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,After that's done, we'll split the money\Nthe way we said, and you'll get half.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.76,0:08:34.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Good riddance.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.84,0:08:36.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I am so over that asshole.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.82,0:08:40.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's no way in hell you'll catch\Nme hanging out with that guy anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.12,0:08:40.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I hear you.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.03,0:08:42.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But when you stop to think about it,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.70,0:08:45.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,we were the ones trying to\Nexploit him for pocket money.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.36,0:08:47.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We should consider what\Nthat says about us.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.16,0:08:49.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You moron. Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.10,0:08:52.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's not how I see\Nthis situation at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.58,0:08:54.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The only reason he got his filthy mitts on
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.06,0:08:57.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the five million was\Nbecause we helped him.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.34,0:09:00.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Without us, he'd be lucky\Nto even get a few thousand.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.14,0:09:03.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But instead, he gets to walk\Naway with 2.5 million yen!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.40,0:09:08.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,2.5 million yen!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.26,0:09:16.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It stays with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.78,0:09:20.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The ticket stays with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.00,0:09:26.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I heard everything, you sneaky douche-bro!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.86,0:09:30.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Neither of you is getting a single\Nyen of my hard-earned winnings!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.32,0:09:33.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We got that five million because\Nof Harvest's amazing ability!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.46,0:09:35.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.48,0:09:39.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You scrubs and your puny stands\Nare nothing compared to my Harvest!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.66,0:09:41.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Want me to prove it to ya?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.50,0:09:44.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We can go at it right\Nnow, what do you say?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.72,0:09:46.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's get it on!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.92,0:09:52.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why you... Freaking great!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.70,0:09:54.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It took the IOU for the money!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.20,0:09:57.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're pissing off the wrong\Nstand users, pineapple head!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.84,0:10:01.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Follow me and I won't\Nhesitate to kill you.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.90,0:10:03.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So back the hell off.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.24,0:10:07.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Shigechi...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.15,0:10:10.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm pretty sure this fool just\Nsaid he was gonna kill us.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.24,0:10:13.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you're so big and bad,\Nsit your stand on us already!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.16,0:10:16.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But the second you do, get\Nready to be ripped apart!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.96,0:10:18.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We got a problem Joe skate.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.98,0:10:22.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What is it something where\Nit's happening in my pants?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.64,0:10:28.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My legs there's something making my\Nlegs it's like a son of a bitch bitch.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.20,0:10:30.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Can't you take care of that later?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.94,0:10:32.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't know you tell me
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.78,0:10:38.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What is happening to me?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.02,0:10:41.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You have to roll up\Nyour pants Okuyasu hurry
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.58,0:10:50.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How did these freaky\Nthings get in my pants?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.44,0:10:58.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Damn, it's no use.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.84,0:11:00.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Knocking just a few of\Nthem off is pointless.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.88,0:11:02.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're gonna have to come at\Nthis from a different angle.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.98,0:11:04.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Aw, damn it.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.58,0:11:06.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Look, he's getting away.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.66,0:11:09.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All right, he's really\Nstarting to piss me off.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.18,0:11:10.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Join the club.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.10,0:11:12.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The guy's been pissing me off all day.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.42,0:11:13.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're coming for you, money.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.68,0:11:14.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just hold on a second.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.64,0:11:16.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This backstabber's about\Nto learn the hard way what
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.04,0:11:20.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,happens to thieving punks\Nwho cross the Josuyasu duo.
