Dialogue: 1,0:11:25.95,0:11:26.99,Eyecatch - Left,signtop,0,0,0,,{\pos(130,372.2)}Higashikata Josuke
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.66,0:11:35.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No one makes a fool out of Okuyasu\Nthe Great and gets away with it.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.04,0:11:37.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll beat him till he's black and blue.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.82,0:11:40.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,At least now we know he's\Nnot just a greedy bastard.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.10,0:11:41.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's a complete idiot too.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.58,0:11:44.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That Butterball may be\Nslippery but there's no way
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.32,0:11:47.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,he'll be able to run long\Nenough to get away from us I
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.34,0:11:50.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Told you look at the little dumbass
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.94,0:11:58.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's like he's a tank and\Nharvest is moving underneath
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.48,0:12:01.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,them like some kind of\Na dark caterpillar trap
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.94,0:12:05.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Actually, it's more like a bucket\Nreally expecting that kind of speed.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.50,0:12:07.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We gotta close the distance
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.50,0:12:21.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's not the brightest boat, but he's\Nactually kind of clever in a weird way.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.12,0:12:23.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's like he's acting on pure instinct.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.96,0:12:26.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh no! He got away! Don't panic yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.92,0:12:28.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I got a trick up my sleeve.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.54,0:12:33.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's gonna have his stand do all the heavy\Nlifting, then we'll just follow suit.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.28,0:12:35.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That money's not getting away!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.00,0:12:36.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I get it!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.30,0:12:45.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's mine now, five million yen.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.38,0:12:49.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Did you really think you could\Nweasel away from us, Shigechi?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.84,0:12:54.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why don't you make Harvest\Nattack us again, pork you prick?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.18,0:12:58.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't wait to pop each and every one\Nof your messed up little mini-me's.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.48,0:13:04.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You've seen firsthand how\Namazing my Harvest is.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.50,0:13:06.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It can collect anything large or small.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.70,0:13:12.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Even the screws that hold pipes together!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.42,0:13:14.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And don't forget the balls!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.38,0:13:18.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Good plan,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.54,0:13:23.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but I think you're forgetting about how\NBites my Shining Diamond's power is!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.46,0:13:31.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's up, friend?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.70,0:13:37.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You've done a real good job\Nof getting on my bad side,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.00,0:13:40.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but I'm still willing to forgive you.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.10,0:13:43.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,First, I want to rearrange\Nthat ugly mug of yours, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.24,0:13:46.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come on, hand over that\NIOU, Shigechi. It's over.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.10,0:13:48.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I told you two fools.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.20,0:13:53.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you chased me, then I'd kill you.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.28,0:13:58.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.58,0:13:59.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My hands are...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.26,0:14:04.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Uh, I can't get up.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.30,0:14:07.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.58,0:14:10.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okuyasu, he's up to something!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.68,0:14:12.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You can't let your guard down!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.84,0:14:14.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You two?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.75,0:14:15.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's he doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.62,0:14:18.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You mean you haven't figured it out yet?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.28,0:14:22.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You two are sloppy drunk\Ncourtesy of this little number.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.88,0:14:24.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is that alcohol?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.42,0:14:27.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My harvest can get its hands on\Nanything I order it to snatch.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.90,0:14:32.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So, I had to grab some booze when\Nwe ran past the liquor store.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.38,0:14:33.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And when you weren't paying attention,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.02,0:14:37.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I injected the hooch into\Nyour stupid lying bodies.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.20,0:14:40.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, to be more specific, I made\Nit squirt right into your veins.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.58,0:14:41.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait, you what?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.42,0:14:45.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Aw, get out!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.90,0:14:49.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,When alcohol goes directly into the veins,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.64,0:14:52.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,you don't need that much until\Nyou're shit-faced and flailing.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.70,0:14:55.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I knew alcohol could be used\Nas a makeshift anesthetic,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.58,0:14:57.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but I never thought a kid\Nwould figure that out?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.42,0:14:59.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,let alone use it to whammy me like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.90,0:15:02.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Looks like he's not a\Ntotal idiot after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.00,0:15:05.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, it must be his instinct again.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.16,0:15:07.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, he's dead meat.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.52,0:15:13.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I might be a little tipsy, but there's no\Nway that's gonna stop me from ending you.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.80,0:15:19.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My frickin' eye!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.48,0:15:23.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What are you waiting for, Josuke? Fix it!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.52,0:15:24.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Shit, hang in there!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.68,0:15:25.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm on it!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.59,0:15:27.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If I'm remembering everything correctly,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.80,0:15:32.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,you two dickwads called me a whole bunch\Nof shitty names earlier, didn't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.08,0:15:34.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna show you what\Nhappens when you try to pull
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.50,0:15:37.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the wool over my eyes and\Ntreat me like a dumb kid.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.94,0:15:38.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Damn you!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.42,0:15:41.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're standing there\Nall high and mighty when
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.60,0:15:44.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,you breaking your promise\Nis what started this!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.10,0:15:45.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've had about all I can take.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.20,0:15:49.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Keep this up and you're not\Ngonna like what comes next.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.50,0:15:53.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I think you've done more than enough\Ntalking for one life, jerks gay.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.08,0:15:57.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And since your stand's weak, your bite\Ncan't even back up your puny bark.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.22,0:15:59.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Actually, both of your stands are shit,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.30,0:16:02.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,so save the demands until you're\Nhalf as strong as Harvest.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.20,0:16:03.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Till then, take it in the eye.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.00,0:16:05.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Quick, Josuke, close your eye!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.36,0:16:08.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.98,0:16:10.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Damn. So close.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.90,0:16:13.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's no point in\Nclosing your eyes, FYI.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.68,0:16:16.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Harvest can grab anything,\Nno matter the obstacle.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.64,0:16:18.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Shut those peepers as tight as you want.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.92,0:16:22.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It'll just tear off your\Neyelids and gouge out the eye.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.32,0:16:25.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We get the point, Shigechi. Stop it.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.94,0:16:27.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just forgive us already.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.44,0:16:29.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's not like we wanted this to happen.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.38,0:16:30.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.29,0:16:31.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Was that an apology?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.42,0:16:32.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Damn it, kid.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.48,0:16:34.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I have had it with your shitty attitude.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.68,0:16:35.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hear that, Okuyasu?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.88,0:16:38.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Josuke seems to be on a completely\Ndifferent page from you.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.72,0:16:39.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't worry about him.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.63,0:16:40.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He'll come around.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.60,0:16:43.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But how about we give you this?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.64,0:16:49.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's the 10,000 yen you gave me, plus\Neverything else I have on me right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.10,0:16:51.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Take it as our penance for\Nall the trouble we've caused.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.62,0:16:54.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Police Shigechi, I'm begging\Nyou not to off Josuke.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.40,0:16:56.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If he gets taken out, who'll fix my eye?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.14,0:16:58.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, Okuyasu!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.06,0:17:00.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh? Oh, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.72,0:17:03.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I almost forgot I gave\Nyou that little handout.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.76,0:17:05.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I felt so bad for you beta boys,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.78,0:17:09.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I decided the only right thing to do\Nwas bless you with over 10,000 yen.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.74,0:17:11.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Here, the money's all yours.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.44,0:17:14.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just have mercy on us,\Nold strong one! I...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.46,0:17:20.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Way to use your brain.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.12,0:17:24.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're trying to lure him in like\Ncatching a raccoon with a bit of bait.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.48,0:17:27.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Once he closes the distance,\Nbam, you'll let him have it.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.26,0:17:30.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, I've got your back, buddy.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.14,0:17:32.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Go for it, man, work your magic.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.88,0:17:34.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's a good boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.32,0:17:36.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't know where this newfound\Nobedience is coming from,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.06,0:17:39.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but I'm glad you know the pecking order.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.80,0:17:46.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Something wonky's going on.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.60,0:17:47.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey now, Okuyasu,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.18,0:17:50.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,it feels like you're trying to lure me in
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.12,0:17:52.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,with cash so you can\Nattack me with your stand.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.48,0:17:54.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But you wouldn't do\Nthat, would you, old pal?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.82,0:17:55.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.78,0:17:57.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So you were trying to trick me.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.80,0:18:03.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Did you think I'd honestly fall for a\Nharebrained scheme as lame as that one?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.04,0:18:06.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You must think I'm some kind of idiot.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.52,0:18:08.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, no pity for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.96,0:18:11.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's not like we needed it anyway.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.64,0:18:13.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Time's run out for you, little man.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.38,0:18:16.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I guess you were too busy\Nflapping your gums like a dumbass
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.52,0:18:20.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,to realize that you walked right\Ninto the hand-striking range.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.78,0:18:23.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll claw away the air\Nand make a teleport,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.16,0:18:26.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,forcing the ticket out of\Nyour hands and back to us.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.38,0:18:27.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This ticket is ours.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.14,0:18:29.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It belongs with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.00,0:18:31.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You know who you're talking to.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.84,0:18:36.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Idiots, you wasted your time\Nbecause I'm about to take it back.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.28,0:18:38.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Incredible, you're even\Ndumber than I thought.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.62,0:18:41.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Your chance of winning just expired\Nand you never saw it coming.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.72,0:18:42.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My money!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.36,0:18:45.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What do you think you're\Ndoing to that ticket?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.44,0:18:48.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's worth five million yen and\Nyou're ripping it up like it's trash!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.92,0:18:50.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why would you do that?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.30,0:18:51.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't get you in the least!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.88,0:18:54.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What was the point in going\Nthrough all this hoopla if you
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.20,0:18:56.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,were just going to rip it up\Nwhen you finally got your way?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.66,0:19:00.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Because of you, I needed a surefire way\Nto stop you from attacking us again.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.92,0:19:03.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Since you can't restore the\Nticket without my shining diamond,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.78,0:19:05.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,giving up is your best bet.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.42,0:19:06.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The fight's over.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.52,0:19:07.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Accept it and stand down.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.20,0:19:09.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, I get it now.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.94,0:19:10.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's what you're doing.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.94,0:19:12.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And off they go.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.60,0:19:14.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Your victory's blowing away in the wind.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.22,0:19:16.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I take it all back.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.13,0:19:17.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't get any of this.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.20,0:19:19.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why would you throw\Naway five million again?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.46,0:19:20.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Have you lost your mind?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.28,0:19:23.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Harvest, bring back every last piece. Go!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.10,0:19:29.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Holy shit, you really\Ndon't get it, do you?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.40,0:19:34.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sending Harvest on a fetch quest\Nwas the final nail in your coffin.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.88,0:19:39.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Your last line of defense is running\Nthrough the city looking for paper scraps.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.74,0:19:42.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,so who's gonna protect you\Nfrom these drunks, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.80,0:19:44.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I think I get it now.
