Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.48,0:19:50.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We did it.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.56,0:19:53.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Since I caught you lying down on the job,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.28,0:19:57.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,why don't we try and get\Nin a bit of study time?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.32,0:20:01.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The scraps of paper floating around\Ntown are picked up by your harvest.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.14,0:20:04.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But after that, who has the\Npower to put them back together?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.94,0:20:05.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hmm?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.88,0:20:06.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I need an answer.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.00,0:20:10.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Who can put the scraps back\Ntogether with Shining Diamond.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.40,0:20:12.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You, Josuke. Josuke?
