Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.20,0:20:16.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes, Mr.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.11,0:20:16.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Josuke, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.18,0:20:19.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ah, now that's what I like to hear.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.14,0:20:23.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And I'm sure you know the name of the\Nperson who recovered that IOU from you.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.16,0:20:25.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, say his name, Half-Pint.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.56,0:20:27.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's Okuyasu, the Great.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.20,0:20:30.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Good, that's our special man.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.36,0:20:33.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So, what do you say we change\Nsubjects and do a little math?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.72,0:20:36.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How do we split five million\Nbetween three people?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.46,0:20:40.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And remember, everyone has to be\Nhappy when all is said and done.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.88,0:20:43.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, I'm fine with half. Half, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.76,0:20:47.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Did I or did I not just tell you\Nthere are three of us to consider?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.08,0:20:50.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How are each of us supposed to\Nget half the winnings, Shigechi?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.08,0:20:53.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Good thing we're studying because\Nyour math needs some work, dude.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.10,0:20:55.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Anyone home?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.38,0:21:01.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I guess I'll be okay with a third.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.60,0:21:08.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now that I think about it, without your\Nhelp, I'd still be collecting old stamps.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.60,0:21:11.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I was acting like a spoiled brat.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.44,0:21:14.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We all found that lottery\Nticket by working as a team.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.88,0:21:18.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If we hadn't banded together, we\Nnever would have pulled it off.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.08,0:21:21.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wow, it's starting to make sense.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.92,0:21:24.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My greed kept me from\Nseeing the big picture.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.00,0:21:28.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's split everything fair and\Nsquare so we all get what we want.
