Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.60,0:21:34.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've never seen so much money before!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.02,0:21:35.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Five million yen!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.93,0:21:38.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you're interested in a home\Nfor your newly acquired wealth,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.94,0:21:41.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,your funds would be very\Nsecure at Budogaoka Bank.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.54,0:21:42.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You bet we're interested!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.88,0:21:44.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We finally did it!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.28,0:21:45.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's like I'm dreaming!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.10,0:21:47.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I have a question.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.32,0:21:50.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Didn't we agree to split the\Nwinnings between the three of us?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.10,0:21:52.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hear me out.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.28,0:21:56.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,In the interest of maintaining a fair\Nand just agreement between us partners,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.26,0:21:59.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,wouldn't it be best to include\Nour stands in this deal?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.54,0:22:01.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I mean, fair is fair, after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.72,0:22:04.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And since Harvest is made\Nup of about 500 mini-stands,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.90,0:22:08.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,we should split the pot\Nfive hundred to one to one.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:08.96,0:22:11.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's not an issue, is it? Uh-huh!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:11.50,0:22:12.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're unbelievable!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:12.74,0:22:16.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I thought you learned your lesson, but\Nyou just don't know when to stop haggling,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:16.32,0:22:17.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,do you?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:17.23,0:22:19.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I was only messing\Naround, a third is fine.
