Dialogue: 0,0:23:28.92,0:23:31.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't know if I need you.
Dialogue: 1,0:23:31.63,0:23:35.01,ED Lyrics,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}Ooh, I would die to find out
